sequenceDiagram
    participant PA as Passenger App
    participant GW as LB + API Gateway
    participant RS as Rating Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant K as Kafka
    participant D as Driver Service
    PA->>GW: POST /ratings
    GW->>RS: сохранить оценку
    RS->>DB: оценка и outbox
    RS-->>PA: 201
    RS--)K: rating.created
    K--)D: rating.created
    D->>DB: пересчёт среднего рейтинга
